lg:CJEU-C-210-16 lgo:caseNumber "C-210/16" ;
    lgo:shortName "Wirtschaftsakademie" ;
    rdfs:comment "The administrator of a Facebook fan page is a controller jointly with Facebook for the data processing of the page's visitors. With Fashion ID, the basis for Article 26 GDPR arrangements with platforms."@en .

lg:CJEU-C-21-23 lgo:caseNumber "C-21/23" ;
    lgo:shortName "Lindenapotheke" ;
    rdfs:comment "The GDPR does not prevent national law from letting competitors sue over GDPR breaches as unfair commercial practices. This is why, in Germany, a competitor's Abmahnung can enforce privacy duties (§ 3a UWG)."@en .

